[HEADER]
id: tide_shrine
title: Shrine Of Eight Knots
ascii_art: ../art/octopus_shrine_anim.txt

[CONTENT]
An ancient octopus coils around a coral altar, each arm marked in gold ink.
It offers one pact: power through blood, or safe passage through oath.

[OPTIONS]
blood_pact | Offer steel and claim the Leviathan Crown -> ../endings/crown_victory.level
oath_pact | Offer rum and swear to guard the reef -> ../endings/reef_alliance.level

[DIRECTIVES]
input_mode: choice
ascii_art_mode: animated

[OPTION_CONDITIONS]
option=blood_pact requires_flag=kraken_wounded
option=oath_pact requires_flag=octopus_favor
